Third-party software and model weights
--------------------------------------

This repository does not redistribute the code, container images or model weights of any third-party tool
(antiSMASH, fungiSMASH, plantiSMASH, GECCO, SanntiS 0.9.5, BGC-Prophet, BGCat, ESM2, ESM C, InterProScan,
NPClassifier, ...). Each tool is referenced by name, version, tag or commit, image digest, source
URL, sha256 and citation (env/containers.tsv, objectives/03-tool-comparison/README.md). The runbooks download the tools from their
publishers at run time, and the Dockerfiles under env/docker/ are built locally and never pushed to a registry.
Each tool keeps its own licence.

Zenodo deposits
---------------

Each deposit listed in env/zenodo.tsv has its own licence and carries its own NOTICE. Deposits contain this
project's data and the outputs of the tools, never the tools themselves.
